  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Variation banks (MSB 0 with a non-zero LSB) are not listed; select them by number.",
    "Program and drum kit names are not included.",
    "The device parameter is 16 plus the instrument's device number (1-16 shown as 0-15 on many instruments).",
    "Parameter changes with more than one data byte are not covered by the template.",
    "Parameter map SysEx entries address part nn with the part's channel index (channel 1 is part 00). That matches XG's default receive channels and is wrong once a part's receive channel is changed.",
    "Parameter map SysEx entries use device number 0 (byte 10H); change \"device\" for another device number.",
    "The NRPN and SysEx filter, vibrato, and EG values are offsets from the voice's own settings: 64 (40H) means no change."
  ]
